      <p class="_abstract">To prevent downtime for your application due to the failure of a single Google Cloud region, you can configure failure domains in the control plane machine set by configuring appropriate values in the <code>failureDomains</code> section of the <code>ControlPlaneMachineSet</code> object.</p>
